BT 1 0 0 1 0 171 Tm 12 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Nine foundational problems in black hole physics -- the singularity, the information paradox, the firewall paradox, the) Tj T* (microscopic origin of Bekenstein-Hawking entropy, supermassive black hole seeding, the M-sigma relation,) Tj T* (intermediate-mass black hole rarity, Hawking radiation non-detection, and gravitational entropy reversal -- are each closed) Tj T* (by a single mechanism: the Wike Coherence Law, C = C_0 ) Tj /F3 9 Tf (exp\(-alpha ) Tj /F1 9 Tf (gamma_eff\). A black hole is not an object of infinite) Tj T* (density. It is the terminal decoherence state of matter-energy: a region where coherence has been driven to its minimum \(C) Tj T* (-) Tj (> 0\) by an environment coupling gamma_eff so extreme that quantum information is maximally scrambled but never) Tj T* (annihilated. This paper builds on the formal proof that black holes are topological absences in spacetime) Tj T* (\(PROOF_BLACK_HOLES_ARE_HOLES\) by demonstrating that every open anomaly in black hole physics dissolves when) Tj T* (the coherence law is applied. No free parameters are introduced. Each closure follows from a single exponential decay) Tj T* (applied to a different physical observable. The singularity is replaced by a Planck-density floor. Information is decohered,) Tj T* (not destroyed. The firewall is revealed as a phase boundary. Bekenstein-Hawking entropy counts decoherence channels.) Tj T* (Supermassive seeds form by direct collapse in high-coherence environments. The M-sigma relation emerges from shared) Tj T* (initial coherence. Intermediate-mass black holes inhabit a decoherence desert. Hawking radiation is exponentially) Tj T* (suppressed. Gravitational entropy reversal follows from the substrate being spacetime itself rather than gas. Nine) Tj T* (anomalies, one law, zero free parameters.) Tj T* ET
